{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the paws of a tiny mouse in <strong>I Am Mouse</strong>, a charming and funny third-person adventure where you create your own path.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/NewLogo.png?t=1752248669\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight, sneak, or explore freely through rich environments full of choices, secrets, and alternate routes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cute hero:</strong> just look at this mouse!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/mouse_new.gif?t=1752248669\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story mode:</strong> your home was destroyed. Find a new home and don't let your family die in this adventure!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/family_new.gif?t=1752248669\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Payday mode:</strong> choose one of the available maps and start searching for food. Be careful! There is a man somewhere in the house... <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/payday.gif?t=1752248669\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your sense of smell</strong> to find traces of food and other useful things.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/sense_new.gif?t=1752248669\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use all your opportunities:</strong> jump on different objects or climb on some cloth/wires to reach the goal.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/parcour.gif?t=1752248669\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remember that you are a little mouse and use it:</strong> hide under the sofa, bed, nightstand and other things!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/little.gif?t=1752248669\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Running away from a person and stuck at a height? No problem:</strong> collect napkins and use them as a parachute!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/parashut_new.gif?t=1752248669\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your mouse:</strong>  change the skin, eye color, grow a mustache and wear hats or tie.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/extras/customize.gif?t=1752248669\" /></div></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1421520?t=1752248669","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752248669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/f41f4af0c7cc710db1466d24b49678aaa7d567a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752248669","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421520/f41f4af0c7cc710db1466d24b49678aaa7d567a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752248669","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":n